# Swingshot anywhere, a zip let go midway (QUEST_VR_OPTIONS="swing_anywhere 1", QUEST_SIM_GIVE=12 QUEST_SIM_HOLD=12,
# at Kerwan's start, a tunnel): the trigger held with the hand 40 degrees up, at the arch 13 units off, and let go in
# the pull (0x25), a few ticks into it: [vr-swing] "let go mid-zip at ... units a second: the speed kept", and the fall
# (6) carries him on; the pulling and state lines say where. (0.1.13's first try aimed 3 down at a step 5 units off,
# whose pull was over before the let-go. The let-go 28 frames in was written on a 31 Hz desktop; at the pinned 60
# frames a second it came before the hook reached the arch, so it is 55 frames in.)
600 y 1
606 y 0
